{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"spades-game UI copy.fields.rulesText","detected_language":"zh","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"spades-game.copy.fields.rulesText","keys":["spades-game.copy.fields.rulesText"],"locale":"zh-CN","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"标准的ZXQPH0000QXZ牌组是平均分配的。 每个玩家都要出售ZXQPH0001QXZ-ZXQPH0002QXZ的招牌;成功的零招牌得分为ZXQPH0003QXZ,失败的零招牌失去ZXQPH0004QXZ。 队伍合同加上他们的非零招牌:每个招牌的ZXQPH0005QXZ点数,加上每个额外招牌的一个袋子;错过它,每个招牌失去ZXQPH0006QXZ点数。 每累积十个袋子减去ZXQPH0007QXZ点数。","record_id":"8b667fa03f85eb915e4317ac5b111dfb5f5eefa0447802ba2e4498b49b8b5038","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":4.1256625431249745,"source":"The standard 52-card deck is dealt evenly. Each player bids 0–13 tricks; a successful nil bid scores 100 and a failed nil loses 100. Team contracts add their non-nil bids: make the total for 10 points per bid, plus one bag for each extra trick; miss it and lose 10 points per bid. Every ten accumulated bags subtract 100 points. Players must follow the suit led when possible. Spades cannot be led until broken unless a player holds only spades, and a spade beats any non-spade card.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"b070b3bdbe8ea9a514fbc13b545bd851619f9a66b846fe5b4b157ec211a4c86c","status":"machine-draft","translation":"标准的52牌组是平均分配的。 每个玩家都要出售0-13的招牌;成功的零招牌得分为100,失败的零招牌失去100。 队伍合同加上他们的非零招牌:每个招牌的10点数,加上每个额外招牌的一个袋子;错过它,每个招牌失去10点数。 每累积十个袋子减去100点数。","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
